{"id":"incluso","lemma":"incluso","pos":"adv","rank":289,"glosses":["even","including"],"ipa":"/inˈkluso/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/40/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-incluso.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me sentía incluso más pequeño.","en":"I felt even smaller.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636493","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to feel","l":"sentir"},null,{"g":"more"},{"g":"small"}]},{"text":"De hecho, él incluso la amaba.","en":"In fact, he even loved her.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639251","words":[null,null,{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"to love","l":"amar"}],"phrases":[[0,2,"in fact"]]},{"text":"Allí hace frío incluso en verano.","en":"It's cold there even in the summer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610777","words":[{"g":"there"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"cold"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"summer"}]},{"text":"Ella vendrá incluso si está cansada.","en":"She will come even if she is tired.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608942","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to come","l":"venir"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied","l":"cansado"}]},{"text":"Tenéis que ir, incluso si no queréis.","en":"You've got to go even if you don't want to.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/608494","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to go"},null,null,null,{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"}],"phrases":[[4,6,"if not"]]}]}